# Keep React Native's own fetch. Expo SDK 57 replaces the global fetch with expo/fetch, which cannot
# send a file part given as { uri, name, type } — the shape every upload in this app uses (staffApi,
# studentApi, portalApi, apiService, ttsClient). Without this, every photo, PDF and recording upload
# throws "Unsupported FormDataPart implementation" before it leaves the phone. Read at bundle time:
# restart Metro with --clear after changing it. eas.json sets the same for store builds.
EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_RN_FETCH=1
